    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hezekia ntemi wa Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Hezekia aho alandya kūtema walī na myaka makūmi abīlī n'ītanò, ūsuga ikanza lya myaka makūmi abīlī na kenda alī mu Yelusalemu. Ū nina witanagwa ī lina lyakwe Abiya nshīke o ng'wa Zakalia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Hezekia akīīta yawiza ū mu miso ga ng'wa SEEBA, gīt'ūmo nkūlūgenji wakwe Daūdi walī wītīla.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hezekia kwandya kwīlonja hekalu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu ng'weji gwa kwandya gwa būsugi wakwe, wīlugūla ī milyango ya hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA, nīyo wībeeja būpya nguno yalī yabipa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbenha a bagabīji na a Balawī, biza bibilinga kū lwandī lwa kīya lwa gwaalugwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūbawīla gīkī, “Nidegelekagi Balawī; iyeejagi ī haha, ng'wīyeeje nī hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA ū Mulungu wa bakūlūgenji bing'we. Wīnjagi pyī ū būsoso ū ng'wipandī ī lyeela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno a bataale bise batītile mitengeke; bakahūba ū mu miso ga ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu wise; būneka būgalūka, būlogeja kūngī ū būshū wabo, kūleka kūlolela ūko lyalī ī lipandī lya kwikala lya ng'wa SEEBA; ū wei būng'winhīla migongo yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nī milyango y'ibīndo bīlugala, nī tala būjileka jūjima; hama booya nū kūzuukīja ū būbbani nūūlū kūfunya shitambò sha kūpemvwa ū ng'wipandī lyeela kūlwa ng'wa Mulungu wa Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū būpelanu bo ng'wa SEEBA būyiidīkīla ī Yuda nī Yelusalemu; ūbīīta kūbiza mashikolo ga kūkamaaja na kogohya, na kūsekwa gīt'ūmo ning'we mulībonela na miso ging'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ī nguno ya bataale bise kūmalwa bo shū; hama kūshisha na haha a bitūnja bise na a bashīke bise, hamò na a bake bise balī mu būding'wa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū, ū nene nalī n'iganiko lya kūbeeja ilagane nū SEEBA, ū Mulungu wa Isilaeli; agalūke būtwīngīle ū būpelanu bokwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bing'we baana bane, ī haha dīīlīlagi gete, nguno ū SEEBA wamusola a bing'we kwīmīīla kū būtongi bokwe na kūntūmamīla; kūbeeja milīmo kū būtongi wakwe na kūzuukīja būbbani.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Balawī kweja hekalu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a Balawī aba, bandya milīmo: Ū kūfuma ū mu shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Kohati; Mahati ng'witūnja o ng'wa Amasai, na Yoeli ng'witūnja o ng'wa Azalia. Ū kūfuma ū mu shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Melaali; Kishi ng'witūnja o ng'wa Abudi, na Azalia ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yehaleleli. Ū kūfuma ū mu shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Gelishoni; Yoa ng'witūnja o ng'wa Zima, na Edeni ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yoa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kūfuma ū mu ba mpanda go ng'wa Elizafati; Shimili na Yeieli. Ū kūfuma ū mu ba mpanda go ng'wa Asafu; Zakalia na Matania. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kūfuma ū mu ba mpanda go ng'wa Hemani; Yehieli na Shimei. Ū kūfuma ū mu ba mpanda go ng'wa Yedusuni; Shemaya na Uzieli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū benaba būbabilinga a baana ba ng'wabo hūna biyeeja, aho bamala bingīla ū mu hekalua ya ng'wa SEEBA, nayo kwīyeeja gīt'ūmo akabawīlīla ū ntemi, kūlenganīla nū mumo gūhayīlile ū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bagabīji bingīla ū ng'wipandī lyeela lya ng'wa SEEBA kūlyeeja. Būlī shikolo shisoso būshifunya, būshenha hanze ha gwaalugwa ya hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA. Hanuma a Balawī būshisola būshitwala kū longa lwa Kiduloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nīmo gwa kweja gīko bakandya ha lūshikū lwa kwandya lwa ng'weji gwa kwandya; aho lūlīshika lūshikū lwa kanaane būshika h'ibīndo lya ng'wa SEEBA. Būtūmama shikū jingī inaane būbiza bīyeeja ī hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA yenekīlī; lūshikū lw'ikūmi n'itandatū ū mu ng'weji gwa kwandya būmala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shigukulu sha kwejiwa hekalu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna būja ū kūlī ntemi būūkang'wīla, “Twamala ū kwīyeeja pyī ī hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA, nū ng'walīlo gwa shitambò sha kūpemvwa nī shitūmamīlo shaho ī shose, nī meza ya kūtūūla migatī myeela nī shikolo shaho ī shose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shikolo īsho ntemi Ahazi walī washīnja kūlwa nguno ya būkenaagūji wakwe aho alī ntemi, twashibeeja chiza tūsheeja. Ī haha shilī kū būtongi bo ng'walīlo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha ntondo yaho ī dilū, ū ntemi Hezekia ūbabiling a batūmami ba būsugi bokwe, ūja nabo ū kū hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Benha nzagamba mpungatī, na ng'ondi nhaale mpungatī, na ng'ondi songi mpungatī, hamò na ngulyati mpungatī; sha kūfunyiwa kūbiza shakwinha sha būkenaagūji kūlwa nguno ya būtemi, na kūlwa ipandī lyeela, na kūlwa sī ya Yuda. Ū ntemi ūbalagīja a bagabīji ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Alooni kūshifunya ī shenīsho a ha ng'walīlo go ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū būjisīnza ī nzagamba, a bagabīji būgasola a mininga būgaseseebela a ha ng'walīlo, hanuma būjisīnza nī ng'ondi, a mininga gajo būgaseseebela a ha ng'walīlo, hanuma būjisīnza nī ng'ondi ī songi, najo a mininga gajo būgaseseebela a ha ng'walīlo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī ngulyati ja shakwinha sha būkenaagūji būjenha kū būtongi wa ntemi nī libità lya banhū; būtūūla a makono gabo a higūlya yajo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a bagabīji būjisīnza ī ngulyati jenījo, a mininga gajo būgatwala a ha ng'walīlo kūbiza shakwinha kūlwa būkenaagūji, kūlwa nguno ya kūtūūla isangī kūlwa Baisilaeli bose, nguno ū ntemi akalagīja gīkī shifunyiwe shitambò sha kūpemvwa na shakwinha sha būkenaagūji kūlwa nguno ya Baisilaeli bose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
